---
title: "Claude activity: source evidence, recovery and stop boundary"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Provider busy: unknown, watcher absent
  s1: Provider busy: busy, watcher absent
  s2: Provider busy: unknown after lease expiry, watcher absent
  s3: Provider busy: busy, watcher attached
  s4: Escape delivered from activity evidence
  s5: Provider busy: unknown after one recovery cycle, watcher absent
  s6: Provider busy: unknown after lease expiry, watcher attached
  s7: Provider busy: unknown after one recovery cycle, watcher attached
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: read current source activity
  s0 --> s2: expire hints and recheck
  s1 --> s3: recover watcher
  s1 --> s2: expire hints and recheck
  s0 --> s4: send stop if authorized
  s2 --> s5: new source progress renews lease
  s1 --> s4: send stop if authorized
  s3 --> s6: expire hints and recheck
  s5 --> s1: read current source activity
  s3 --> s4: send stop if authorized
  s5 --> s4: send stop if authorized
  s6 --> s7: new source progress renews lease
  s7 --> s3: read current source activity
  s7 --> s4: send stop if authorized
